From e0d482ef5b0f93ebf59dfa75cfde7a4c545b2985 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:18:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: Fonts page, main display notifications, type to
 search, Narrator paused

- Personalization > Fonts has System font and Monospace font (moved from
  Colors, which no longer shows them in the Lapin session). The chosen
  system font is saved for the shell before it changes, so the shell
  keeps it (#40).
- Display: turning "Make this my main display" on says which display is
  now the main one; turning it off goes back to the default, Display 1,
  and says so. Display 1 stays the main display when it is the default
  (#31).
- Typing while Settings has focus fills the search box with the whole
  text and keeps typing there (#48).
- Accessibility > Vision hides the screen reader rows while the Narrator
  is paused (#18, #44).

COSMIC's own session is unchanged.

Refs #40, Refs #31, Refs #48, Refs #18
